      "type": "code",
      "text": "from itertools import *\ncnt = 0\nfor p in product('0123456789AB', repeat=6):\n    num = ''.join(p)\n    if num[0] != '0' and num.count('7') == 1:\n        if len([x for x in num if int(x, 12) > 9]) <= 3:\n            cnt += 1\nprint(cnt)\n\n# Ответ: 888669"
